    <briefdescription>
<para>Image data from a measurement. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>See <ref refid="structcuvis_1_1common__image__t" kindref="compound">common_image_t</ref> for single pixel access. The <ref refid="structcuvis_1_1image__t_1ac407bec318ae06663d61b3b31a1fafab" kindref="member">_wavelength</ref> is either a nullptr or, if set contains the cube&apos;s wavelengths in nano meter.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data_t</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The pixel bit depth, either std::uint8_t, std::uint16_t, std::uint32_t or float </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
